<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="411213290"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1101637250"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Lonely Feather"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="千菅春香"/><amll:meta key="album" value="愛の詩-words of love-"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="01:33.970"><div begin="00:08.070" end="01:33.970"><p begin="00:08.070" end="00:12.450" itunes:key="L1">In my eye and in my way<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在我眼里 在我的旅程里</span></p><p begin="00:12.450" end="00:16.960" itunes:key="L2">In the sky so far away</p><p begin="00:16.960" end="00:21.460" itunes:key="L3">Are you hiding in the grey<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是否藏在灰暗的角落</span></p><p begin="00:21.460" end="00:26.150" itunes:key="L4">I am on my way to find you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我踏上了寻找你的旅途</span></p><p begin="00:26.150" end="00:30.360" itunes:key="L5">In the shadow where you lay</p><p begin="00:30.360" end="00:33.420" itunes:key="L6">In the darkness I'll be praying<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无边的黑暗中 我将会祈祷</span></p><p begin="00:33.420" end="00:44.190" itunes:key="L7">one by one in a lonely lullaby<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一首首孤独的摇篮曲</span></p><p begin="00:44.190" end="00:48.130" itunes:key="L8">Dancing like a lonely feather<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">像是孤独的羽毛飘飞天际</span></p><p begin="00:48.130" end="00:50.550" itunes:key="L9">In the windy weather<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">肆虐的风里</span></p><p begin="00:50.550" end="00:53.840" itunes:key="L10">Looking for a beacon and some clarity</p><p begin="00:53.840" end="00:57.280" itunes:key="L11">Long to fly again together<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">渴望再一次高飞</span></p><p begin="00:57.280" end="00:59.530" itunes:key="L12">And I wonder whether<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们会找到属于我们的旋律</span></p><p begin="00:59.530" end="01:02.720" itunes:key="L13">We will ever find our melody</p><p begin="01:02.720" end="01:07.340" itunes:key="L14">Over mountain and below the stars<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">高山之巅 星光之下</span></p><p begin="01:07.340" end="01:11.900" itunes:key="L15">Light my way so I know where you are</p><p begin="01:11.900" end="01:14.180" itunes:key="L16">And find me,<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论何时无论何地 我都会为你高唱</span></p><p begin="01:14.180" end="01:25.270" itunes:key="L17">Anywhere and anytime I sing my song for you</p><p begin="01:25.270" end="01:29.520" itunes:key="L18">My tomorrow my today</p><p begin="01:29.520" end="01:33.970" itunes:key="L19">It is time for you to find your way<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是时候找寻你的旅途了</span></p></div></body></tt>